\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}miller\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MillerCondition}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land T\\subseteq\\omega^{\\uparrow&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall s\\in\\omega^{\\uparrow&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(s\\subseteq t\\to s\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;\n\\left(\ns\\subseteq t\n\\land\n\\left|\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\right|\n=\\aleph_0\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}miller\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MillerCondition}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land T\\subseteq\\omega^{\\uparrow&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall s\\in\\omega^{\\uparrow&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(s\\subseteq t\\to s\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;\n\\left(\ns\\subseteq t\n\\land\n\\left|\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\right|\n=\\aleph_0\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus a condition is a nonempty downward-closed superperfect tree, not merely\nan arbitrary family in which each listed node has a splitting extension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forc